>Level 37 (The Poolrooms)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 188 (The Windows)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Fun! (The Playrooms)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 4 (Abandoned Office)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And More!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First/Third Person Shooter Combat:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >survive against waves of zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >collect new weapons, and discover new abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Labyrinth:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lethal-like scrap retrieval with a biopunk twist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >harvest organs and gather evidence to sell and meet your quota</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >survive against the hoards of zombified D-Class personnel, infected by SCP-3127 and SCP-7475-J</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >find lesser cores to travel farther down the labyrinth, until you find a greater core to extract</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >survive the extraction event to earn your rewards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
